{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222110","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222110","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1522211001:0":{"text":"Excuse me, are you the lieutenant's soldiers?","source_cn":"几位大人，你们是副将大人的手下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91FF3AFD2B006B90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1522211001":{"text":"Excuse me, are you the lieutenant's soldiers?","source_cn":"几位大人，你们是副将大人的手下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91FF3AFD2B006B90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522211002:0":{"text":"Wh-what?","source_cn":"什……什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F9043C8DE6D9833","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522211003:0":{"text":"Let me introduce us. The three of us are members of the Arcane Council. We came to Halia to meet with the Regulus.","source_cn":"请容许我做自我介绍：我们三人是魔法师协会的成员，此次来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC82CA2A48DC8021","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522211004:0":{"text":"Mages? Meeting the Regulus? You must be someone important...","source_cn":"魔法师？还能面见领主？那你们一定都是了不起的大人物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E3FF738796C48BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522211005:0":{"text":"Anyway... *Cough*\nCould I ask a favor? Could you pass my thanks along to the lieutenant?","source_cn":"总之……咳咳！\\n总之能不能拜托你们，把我的谢意转达给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9F243DC0617F05F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1522211005":{"text":"Anyway... *Cough*\nCould I ask a favor? Could you pass my thanks along to the lieutenant?","source_cn":"总之……咳咳！\\n总之能不能拜托你们，把我的谢意转达给副将大人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9F243DC0617F05F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522211006:0":{"text":"Thank him? That lieutenant nearly threw me in jail! Nim, don't fall for his act!","source_cn":"谢他？那个副将差点要把我抓走！尼姆，你别被他骗了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5233AD9CADD27FA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1522211007:1":{"text":"*Cough* Siman, don't be like that. He was misled, that's all.","source_cn":"咳咳咳……西蒙，别这样说。副将大人只是被蒙蔽了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x642909D984E07521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522211008:0":{"text":"You know how Jakon and his lot are. <style=\"highlight\">Every time there's a food handout, they show up trying to grab more than their share</style>.","source_cn":"你又不是不认识伊阿宋那群人……<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4177F8DEB3A4EAEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522211009:0":{"text":"If it weren't for <style=\"highlight\">General Perseus sending guards to keep watch</style>, we'd have starved to death long ago...","source_cn":"如果不是<style=highlight>统帅大人常常...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA5DD12D0F3E023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522211010:0":{"text":"If you don't mind me asking, the soldiers handing out food today—were they sent by Perseus himself?","source_cn":"恕我冒昧，今日发放粮食的士兵也是珀尔修斯派来的亲卫兵吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EC900860CD1FFB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1522211011:1":{"text":"During that earlier fight, their actions didn't exactly win anyone over.","source_cn":"适才发生争执时，他们的作为并不能服众。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B57802D6675008C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1522211012:0":{"text":"I heard the general's been staying near the front lines. Hasn't had much time for city matters.","source_cn":"统帅大人最近好像一直在前线，不怎么插手城内的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9FA972BA8242807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1522211013:0":{"text":"If he were here, I wouldn't waste my breath arguing with that weasel...","source_cn":"要不是这样，我也不想浪费力气和那个无耻的家伙吵架……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3DD34003A7275B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1522211014:0":{"text":"Good thing... good thing the lieutenant showed up in person.","source_cn":"幸好……幸好副将大人亲自来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1380529CB22B3E2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1522211015:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">He's Perseus' right hand. He has to stand up for us</style>. *Cough* Siman, we shouldn't doubt him.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>他是统帅大人的副将，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A4057EE31BAA883","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1522211016:0":{"text":"Look... didn't he send those people packing? Told them they couldn't take any food?","source_cn":"你看……他不是把那些人赶走，不让他们领粮食了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF969E915FE5920D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1522211017:0":{"text":"I mean... I hope you're right.","source_cn":"唉，我也不希望真是那样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE6A4905F398EB4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1522211018:0":{"text":"Perseus is a good man. If he picked that lieutenant himself, maybe he's not so bad either...","source_cn":"统帅那么好的人，他亲自挑选的副将应该也不是坏人吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13B5D7CA1B0F228D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"Thank him for what?","source_cn":"干嘛谢他？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6AD065EB3B5B75BD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Thank him for what?","female":"Thank him for what?","variant_male_record_index":"77110","variant_female_record_index":"77111","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"He was clearly taking sides.","source_cn":"你没看出来他在拉偏架吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3831F87D502E66A2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"He was clearly taking sides.","female":"He was clearly taking sides.","variant_male_record_index":"77112","variant_female_record_index":"77113","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:2:3":{"text":"You should be thanking us!","source_cn":"你应该感谢我们才对！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x693AF62EDD40B264","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You should be thanking us!","female":"You should be thanking us!","variant_male_record_index":"77114","variant_female_record_index":"77115","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"Don't make me laugh!","source_cn":"我？他的手下？别开玩笑了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x50322FAF5A2CAC27","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Don't make me laugh!","female":"Don't make me laugh!","variant_male_record_index":"77104","variant_female_record_index":"77105","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"We're mages!","source_cn":"我们是魔法师！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x435CB1ED88173010","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We're mages!","female":"We're mages!","variant_male_record_index":"77106","variant_female_record_index":"77107","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:2:3":{"text":"We're the ones saving Halia!","source_cn":"我们是呼临城的救世主！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCCCFCE706EBB573E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We're the ones saving Halia!","female":"We're the ones saving Halia!","variant_male_record_index":"77108","variant_female_record_index":"77109","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:尼姆":{"text":"Nim","source":"尼姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"Merlin the First","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:西蒙":{"text":"Siman","source":"西蒙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":27,"localized_text_count":26,"speaker_count":3}}